Together with [[https://www.uni-frankfurt.de/115666234/Prof__Dr__Jakob_Stix][Jakob Stix]] and [[https://marcin-lara.github.io/][Marcin Lara]], I’m organizing a [[https://crc326gaus.de/gaus-ag/][GAUS-AG]] on the use of the étale fundamental gerbe in anabelian geometry.
A detailed programme can be found [[https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tholzschuh/uni-files/master/teaching/GAUS-AG-EtFdtlGerbe.pdf][here]].

+ When? Roughly every two weeks on Wednesday.
+ Where? We’re rotating between Heidelberg and Frankfurt.
+ Check out the programme for specific dates and places.
